  "provider": "nowcoding",
  "requestedModel": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T21:56:29.095894Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-20T06:26:33.184349Z",
  "totalBlocks": 44,
  "translatedBlocks": 39,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff69dba0044bd894",
      "translationZh": "LLM-as-a-Judge（用大语言模型担任评判者）已成为对 LLM 应用的自然语言输出进行评分的一种流行方式，但我们如何知道哪些模型最适合担任评判者？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ea19991e8ca6697",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴推出 Judge Arena——一个让任何人都能轻松并排比较不同模型评判表现的平台。只需让这些评判模型对一个测试样本进行评判，再投票选出你最认同的评判模型即可。结果将汇总成排行榜，展示表现最佳的评判模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8a5c4d7b90668e88",
      "translationZh": "裁判竞技场",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f30fd1e66ead944a",
      "translationZh": "事实证明，众包式随机对战能够有效地对 LLM 进行基准评测。LMSys 的 Chatbot Arena 已收集超过 200 万张选票，作为识别最佳语言模型的实地测试平台而备受推崇。由于 LLM 评估旨在捕捉人类偏好，直接的人类反馈也是确定哪些 AI 评判者最有帮助的关键。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "运作方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ea54988383059fb",
      "translationZh": "选择要评估的样本：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e5cb9508b62fd681",
      "translationZh": "让系统随机生成一组 👩 用户输入 / 🤖 AI 回复",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16664ea8dc33c913",
      "translationZh": "或者输入你自己的自定义样本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "770804c3e8a0f873",
      "translationZh": "两位大语言模型评审将：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8648a9564bb76fbf",
      "translationZh": "为回答打分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59525548bc8404da",
      "translationZh": "说明各自的评分理由",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f27cdf1ed6873c30",
      "translationZh": "查看两位评审的评价，并投票选出最符合你判断的那一份",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97fb2a98763c6425",
      "translationZh": "（我们建议先查看评分，再比较评语）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c5a6206834e3556",
      "translationZh": "每次投票后，你可以：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9edfd6e388532bc1",
      "translationZh": "重新生成评审：获取对同一样本的新评价",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ac75cfd30a9a6a2",
      "translationZh": "开始 🎲 新一轮：随机生成一个新样本供评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "133be08e8cdd2653",
      "translationZh": "或者，输入一个新的自定义样本进行评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df031c9336d32962",
      "translationZh": "为避免偏见和潜在滥用，只有在提交投票后才会公布模型名称。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c3fee44c75ba2525",
      "translationZh": "所选模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49df7e7a71beefe2",
      "translationZh": "Judge Arena 专注于 LLM-as-a-Judge 方法，因此仅纳入生成式模型（不包括仅输出分数的分类器模型）。我们将 AI 评判模型的筛选标准明确规定如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba61ce6ce831aadf",
      "translationZh": "模型应具备对其他模型的输出进行有效评分和点评的能力，两者缺一不可。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cd974ace3205bcb5",
      "translationZh": "模型应能够通过提示，针对不同标准、采用不同评分格式进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b83fdbd2e9000968",
      "translationZh": "我们为排行榜选取了 18 个当前最先进的 LLM。其中许多是权重公开的开源模型，同时我们也纳入了通过 API 提供服务的专有模型，以便直接比较开放与封闭两种路线。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83effd68b1248885",
      "translationZh": "阿里巴巴（Qwen 2.5 Instruct Turbo 7B / 72B、Qwen 2 Instruct 72B）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2cd9d46384be5499",
      "translationZh": "当前列表涵盖了 AI 评估流水线中最常用的模型。如果我们的排行榜被证明有用，我们期待加入更多模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1fd6b251c11baf0e",
      "translationZh": "排行榜",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4da02da0ba7bffe4",
      "translationZh": "从 Judge Arena 收集的投票将汇总并展示在一个专门的公开排行榜上。我们会为每个模型计算 Elo 评分，并每小时更新排行榜。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "82f00c39bc575412",
      "translationZh": "初步观察",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a4710b2cb78ca9a",
      "translationZh": "这些还只是非常初步的结果，但以下是我们目前观察到的情况：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a3758d0f00d7a99",
      "translationZh": "表现领先者既有专有模型，也有开源模型：GPT-4 Turbo 以微弱优势领先，但 Llama 和 Qwen 模型极具竞争力，超过了大多数专有模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f2c0fe77b60e55a",
      "translationZh": "较小模型的表现令人印象深刻：Qwen 2.5 7B 和 Llama 3.1 8B 表现出色，能够与规模大得多的模型竞争。随着收集到更多数据，我们希望能更好地理解模型规模与评判能力之间的关系。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "53e4527dfca9073c",
      "translationZh": "为新兴研究提供初步实证支持：LLM-as-a-Judge 相关文献表明，Llama 模型非常适合作为基础模型，在评估基准上展现出强大的开箱即用性能。包括 Lynx、Auto-J 和 SFR-LLaMA-3.1-Judge 在内的多种方法，都选择以 Llama 模型为起点，再通过后训练来培养评估能力。我们的暂定结果与这一趋势一致，其中 Llama 3.1 70B 和 405B 分别排名第 2 和第 3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "087bb88ee653bdd3",
      "translationZh": "随着排行榜在未来几周逐渐成形，我们期待在博客上分享对结果的进一步分析。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3b4cdc3dac476229",
      "translationZh": "如何参与贡献",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71f49ba0b7be2c48",
      "translationZh": "我们希望 Judge Arena 能成为对社区有帮助的资源。通过为这个排行榜贡献数据，你将帮助开发者确定在评估流程中使用哪些模型。我们承诺在未来几个月内分享 20% 的匿名化投票数据，希望开发者、研究人员和用户能利用我们的发现，构建更符合人类偏好的评估器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbe5c44edd1c110e",
      "translationZh": "我们很想听听你的反馈！如有一般性的功能需求，或想提交 / 建议将新模型加入竞技场，请在社区选项卡中发起讨论，或在 Discord 上与我们交流。如果你有任何问题或建议，也欢迎随时在 X/Twitter 上给我们发消息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2db8e6bec99b53df",
      "translationZh": "目前，Atla 自掏腰包为这个项目提供资金。我们正在寻求不附带任何条件的 API 额度，以支持这项社区工作——如果你有兴趣合作，请通过 support@atla-ai.com 联系我们 🤗",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2a6b24ad28722034",
      "translationZh": "致谢",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee6c98a7a088f93a",
      "translationZh": "感谢所有帮助测试这个竞技场的朋友，也感谢 LMSYS 团队带来的灵感。特别感谢 Clémentine Fourrier 和 Hugging Face 团队，让这一切成为可能！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
